<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal appoints board to public credit body.</title>
<headline>Portugal appoints board to public credit body.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portuguese cabinet appointed the board of the recently established Institute of Management of Public Credit and named Vitor Bento, director-general of the Treasury, as its president, a statement said.</p>
<p>The Institute of Management of Public Credit was formed last month to manage Portugal's public debt.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
